<title>DUBAI: QUALITY-LUFTHANSA SHARJAH JULY CARGO REPORT.</title>
<headline>QUALITY-LUFTHANSA SHARJAH JULY CARGO REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo AG, an autonomous unit of Deutsche Lufthansa AG, issued its latest monthly report on service standards achieved at its Sharjah, United Arab Emirates hub.</p>
<p>The report gives results claimed by LCAG Sharjah for July.</p>
<p>    Customer commitment			     Achievement</p>
<p>						   July 1997	June 1997</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------- Flown as booked				99 pct	     99 pct</p>
<p>Import cargo ready for pick up</p>
<p>-perishables: one hour after</p>
<p>     flight arrival			 100 pct	    100 pct</p>
<p>-general: five hours after</p>
<p>     flight arrival			 100 pct	    100 pct</p>
<p>Export acceptance waiting time	   99 pct	     99 pct</p>
<p>    up to one tonne:    one hour</p>
<p>one to five tonnes: two hours</p>
<p>five to ten tonnes: three hours</p>
<p>Telephone answered by third ring	 85 pct	     83 pct</p>
<p>- Dubai newsroom +9714-626990</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
</text>
